{"id":"0c9aef3f96f3e90f","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-hif-not-traceable-cardinality.md","title":"超免疫自由与可计算可迹性的连续统分离","display":"thm-hif-not-traceable-cardinality — 超免疫自由与可计算可迹性的连续统分离","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-hif-not-traceable-cardinality","aliases":["43-thm-hif-not-traceable-cardinality"],"display":"thm-hif-not-traceable-cardinality — 超免疫自由与可计算可迹性的连续统分离","depends_on":["[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[43-df-computably-traceable]]","[[43-df-dstr]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Thm.16.1.4, printed p.481 / PDF p.501","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-hif-not-traceable-cardinality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-hif-not-traceable-cardinality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hif-not-traceable-cardinality — 超免疫自由与可计算可迹性的连续统分离"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" href=\"?note=abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" title=\"43-df-computably-traceable\">43-df-computably-traceable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0857d6ab104a439b\" href=\"?note=0857d6ab104a439b\" title=\"43-df-dstr\">43-df-dstr</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thm.16.1.4, printed p.481 / PDF p.501"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{deg}\">\\(\\operatorname{deg}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0857d6ab104a439b\" href=\"?note=0857d6ab104a439b\" title=\"43-df-dstr\">43-df-dstr</a> 的Turing度映射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" href=\"?note=abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" title=\"43-df-computably-traceable\">43-df-computably-traceable</a>。所有集合均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left|\\{\\operatorname{deg}(A):A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A)\\}\\right|=2^{\\aleph_0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left|\\{\\operatorname{deg}(A):A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A)\\}\\right|=2^{\\aleph_0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书陈述是连续统多个超免疫自由但不可计算可迹的度。此处保留该精确方向，不把它误抄为连续统多个可计算可迹度。书后紧邻文字“no computably traceable degree is Δ02”遗漏了非零条件，不能用来排除可计算度；本原子没有采用该句。定理陈述已核对，基定理与连续统规模的构造细节本轮未完整重验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computably-traceable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dstr","status":"resolved","id":"0857d6ab104a439b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dstr]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dstr","status":"resolved","id":"0857d6ab104a439b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{deg}$ 是 [[43-df-dstr]] 的Turing度映射；$\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}$ 见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}$ 见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]。所有集合均属于 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{deg}$ 是 [[43-df-dstr]] 的Turing度映射；$\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}$ 见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}$ 见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]。所有集合均属于 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{deg}$ 是 [[43-df-dstr]] 的Turing度映射；$\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}$ 见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}$ 见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]。所有集合均属于 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\